    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37621" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξοστεΐζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>take out the bones,</i> prob. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Horap.
				2.38
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔξαρθρος;</span>
			
			<i>take out of the bone,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυελόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.77
				</span></i>
			: metaph., of fruits, <i>remove the seeds</i> or
				<i>kernels,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆλα . . ἐξωστεϊσμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.75
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαιῶν -ισμένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.47.7
			</span></i>.</div>
